-uid-box\">0db056b3-23d1-4873-883d-482b5d9337b5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0db056b3-23d1-4873-883d-482b5d9337b5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0db056b3-23d1-4873-883d-482b5d9337b5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">FOR_SpiderQueen_Robe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:FOR_SpiderQueen_Robe+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:FOR_SpiderQueen_Robe+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Trails\" title=\"Poison Trails\">Poison Trails</a></dt><dd>When the wearer casts a spell that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage, it deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-569&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-359</span>: Carried by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/38px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/50px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png/25px-Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Portrait_Phase_Spider_Matriarch.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a> in her lair</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Appearance in game</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png/450px-Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png/675px-Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoner's Robe worn by Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png/450px-Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Poisoner%27s_Robe_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 114.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 112.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Poisoner%27s_Robe_Human_Front_Mode